@page "/unsloth"
@inject Appliance Device
<PageTitle>Unsloth · Xur</PageTitle>
<div class="page-heading"><h1>Unsloth Studio</h1><a class="button secondary" href="/profiles">Profiles</a></div>
@if(Device.Installer) { <p>Unsloth is available after installation.</p> }
else
{
    <section class="panel" id="unsloth-page">
        <AntiforgeryToken />
        <p>Add <strong>Unsloth · Model training</strong> to a profile, select an NVIDIA GPU, then load the profile. The latest image is downloaded before each start. A running server stays on its current version until unloaded and loaded again.</p>
        <p id="unsloth-status" role="status">Checking server…</p>
        <div id="unsloth-running" hidden>
            <div class="actions"><a id="unsloth-open" class="button" hidden target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Unsloth Studio</a></div>
            <p>Your Xur sign-in opens the shared Studio owner account through Tailscale HTTPS on port 8444. Everyone with manager access shares its chats, files and training jobs. Signing out of Xur disconnects Studio; training jobs continue on the server.</p>
        </div>
        <form id="unsloth-connect" hidden>
            <p>This Studio account already has a password. Enter it once to let Xur manage sign-in. Xur will replace it with a private generated password and preserve your account and files.</p>
            <label for="unsloth-password">Current Studio password</label>
            <input id="unsloth-password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required maxlength="4096" />
            <button id="unsloth-submit" type="submit">Connect Studio to Xur</button>
        </form>
        <p><a href="/tailscale">Tailscale connection and HTTPS settings</a></p>
        <p id="unsloth-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
        <h2>Persistent storage</h2>
        <p>Save training files and downloaded models under <code>/workspace</code>. Studio settings, accounts and outputs also persist. All Unsloth profiles share this storage; unloading or deleting a profile keeps it.</p>
        <p>Xur’s downloaded models are available read-only at <code>/models</code> and complete model snapshots at <code>/model-sets</code>. Save fine-tuned models to <code>/workspace</code> to keep the original downloads intact.</p>
    </section>
    <script src="/unsloth.js" defer></script>
}
